<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Retro Rotation — {{ team_id }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Retro Rotation — {{ team_id }}</h1>
<ul><li>owner: {{ named_person }}; guide_date: YYYY-MM-DD</li></ul>
<h2>History (three most recent committed instances, newest first; fewer than 3: skip = &quot;history &lt; 3&quot;, no pick)</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Retro date</th><th>Instance ref (committed path)</th><th>Format</th><th>Action items</th><th>Participants</th><th>Silent participants</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>YYYY-MM-DD</td><td>retros/&lt;team&gt;/&lt;date&gt;.json</td><td>{format}</td><td>N</td><td>N</td><td>N</td></tr><tr><td>YYYY-MM-DD</td><td>retros/&lt;team&gt;/&lt;date&gt;.json</td><td>{format}</td><td>N</td><td>N</td><td>N</td></tr><tr><td>YYYY-MM-DD</td><td>retros/&lt;team&gt;/&lt;date&gt;.json</td><td>{format}</td><td>N</td><td>N</td><td>N</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Format last used (all seven; null = never)</h2>
<p>start-stop-continue: YYYY-MM-DD | sailboat: ... | 4ls: ... | timeline: ... | anonymous-async: ... | mad-sad-glad: ... | lean-coffee: ...</p>
<h2>Team state</h2>
<ul><li>Distribution: async | hybrid | in-person</li><li>Fatigue signal: fresh | rotating | fatigued</li></ul>
<h2>Stale formats (detector output; each with its signal)</h2>
<ul><li>{format}: twice_in_last_3 | action_items_dropped_over_50pct | two_or_more_silent_participants</li></ul>
<h2>Refresh trend</h2>
<ul><li>consecutive_rotations_without_refresh: 0 | 1 | 2 (2: escalation = fatigue_is_not_a_format_problem; team_health_route = team-morale-pulse-survey | solo-burnout-tripwires; no pick)</li></ul>
<h2>Pick (not in the last 3, not stale; async teams: async pool with anonymous input; fatigued: unused 12 months)</h2>
<ul><li>next_format: {format}; tie_breaker: no_repeat_only | async_pool | async_pool_exhausted | fatigued_12_month_lookback | in_person_sailboat_or_lean_coffee | reflective_mid_cycle_4ls</li><li>exception_recorded: yes | no; next_format_last_used: YYYY-MM-DD | never; anonymous_async_input: yes | no</li></ul>
<h2>Rationale (&gt;= 20 chars; names the three previous formats, distribution, fatigue signal and the deciding tie-breaker; fatigued: when the format was last used)</h2>
<p>{...}</p>
<h2>Outcome review</h2>
<ul><li>Cadence: next-retro | monthly | quarterly</li><li>Last run: YYYY-MM-DD (the scheduled retro's counts are recorded here and become the next guide's history)</li></ul>
</body></html>
